The key service needs were to:  
• agree and accept a well-defined study objective;  
• Read local data (JSON/CSV) for course and availability information;  
• produce prioritised and planned study activities;  
• recheck the plan formed based on set rules;  
• only give 2 revision chances;  
• retain execution-scoped state;  
